# Public form controls

Never drop a raw browser-default control onto a public page.

- Text, email, tel, number, textarea, file, and **select** use the `ng-field` class (or `<x-public.form.input>` / `<x-public.form.select>` / `<x-public.form.textarea>`).
- Dates use `<x-public.date-picker>`. Do **not** use `<input type="date">` (native calendar).
- Selects must keep `ng-field` so the custom chevron applies. Do not leave an unstyled `<select>`.
- Do not import or start a second Alpine instance in `resources/js/app.js`. Livewire owns Alpine; register plugins on `alpine:init` only.
